# Vendored shadcn components.
#
# These are generated by the shadcn CLI and re-generated on upgrade, so formatting them
# creates diff noise that the next `shadcn add` throws away. It also breaks the build:
# their Tailwind class strings contain escaped quotes — `[&_svg:not([class*=\'size-\'])]`
# — and Prettier's quote normalisation drops the escaping, leaving a single-quoted string
# containing single quotes that Vue's template compiler cannot parse. `vite build`
# tolerates it; `vite build --ssr` does not.
resources/js/*/components/ui/**
stubs/**/components/ui/**

# Saucebase's own components living under the same roof are ours to format.
!resources/js/*/components/ui/saucebase/**

# Generated passthroughs and type declarations — regenerated by module tooling.
resources/js/*/generated.d.ts
modules/*/resources/js/app.ts
modules/*/resources/js/types/generated.d.ts

# Build output and dependencies.
public/build/**
node_modules/**
vendor/**
